  "name": "Devil Lake",
  "author": "Roma_emu",
  "description": "This is my second AWDS map. I made it because I noticed there were no game-default maps featuring everything (towers, silos, land/naval/air combat, pipes, predeployed+bases misc, dual-screen friendly) AWDS has to offer. So I present you this highly strategical (and fun) map...\r\n\r\n\r\nThere's a building below each predeployed neutral unit. They are there just to slow you down.\r\n\r\nTank: silo.\r\nInfantry: base.\r\nB-Copters: airport.\r\nCruiser: port.\r\nMech: com tower.\r\nPiperunner: pipe seam.\r\nOozium: silo.\r\nStealth: airport.\r\nOS/BM Artillery: OS/BM city.\r\nOS/BM Anti-Air: neutral com tower.\r\nOS/BM/GE Mech: mountain (in the north).",
